```

Field utama:

```text
id
source_transaction_id
verified_user_id
consumable_id
required_quantity
status
created_at
updated_at
```

## 3.2 Tabel Settlement

```text
trs_wh_used_return_settlements
```

Field:

```text
id
obligation_id
return_transaction_id
quantity
created_at
```

Outstanding dihitung:

```text
required_quantity
-
SUM(settlements.quantity)
```

Jangan hanya menyimpan satu angka hutang mutable tanpa settlement history.

## 3.3 Integration Flow

### Saat OUT NEW

```text
Create transaction OUT
↓
Create obligation
↓
required = quantity OUT
```

### Saat langsung return USED

```text
OUT NEW
+ IN USED
↓
operation_key sama
↓
create obligation
↓
create settlement
```

### Saat return berikutnya

```text
USED IN
↓
hubungkan ke obligation OPEN
↓
create settlement
↓
update status
```

## 3.4 Reversal

Harus ditangani.

```text
OUT NEW 10
→ debt 10
→ reversal OUT
→ obligation tidak boleh tetap aktif
```

Begitu juga jika return USED direversal:

```text
Debt 10
Return 4
Debt 6
Reverse Return
Debt kembali 10
```

